<% const format=n=>Number(n).toLocaleString('en-US'),interval=locals.billingInterval==='annual'?'annual':'monthly',compared=offer.comparison(plans),label=a=>a.meter==='ai_work_credits'?'AI credits':a.meter==='members'?'People':a.meter==='workspaces'?'Inventories':a.label; %>
<div class="pro-pricing"><section class="pricing-intro"><div><p class="pub-kicker">Pricing</p><h1>Choose a plan that fits your business</h1><p>Inventory, purchasing, sales and accounting in one place. Pay by card, with a 14-day money-back guarantee.</p></div><nav aria-label="Billing interval"><a class="pub-btn" href="/pricing?interval=monthly" <%- interval==='monthly'?'aria-current="page"':'' %>>Monthly</a><a class="pub-btn" href="/pricing?interval=annual" <%- interval==='annual'?'aria-current="page"':'' %>>Annual billing</a></nav></section>
<% if(!checkoutOpen){ %><p class="pub-notice">Paid signup is unavailable on this installation. Contact us by email to discuss your setup.</p><% } %><% if(checkoutCancelled){ %><p class="pub-notice">Checkout was cancelled. No subscription was activated.</p><% } %>
<section class="plan-ladder plan-comparison" aria-label="StockChief plans"><% for(const plan of compared){const team=plan.allowances.find(a=>a.meter==='members'),price=interval==='annual'?plan.annual_amount_minor:plan.monthly_amount_minor; %><article class="plan-card <%= plan.is_recommended?'is-recommended':'' %>" id="<%= plan.id %>" data-plan="<%= plan.id %>" data-monthly-minor="<%= plan.monthly_amount_minor??'' %>" data-annual-minor="<%= plan.annual_amount_minor??'' %>"><header><h2><%= plan.name %></h2><% if(plan.is_recommended){ %><span class="plan-popular">Most popular</span><% } %></header><p class="plan-promise"><%= plan.sales_only?'Capacity and service agreed for your business.':team?.units!=null?'For a team of up to '+format(team.units)+' people.':'Room for your business to grow.' %></p><div class="plan-price"><% if(plan.sales_only||price==null){ %><strong>Agreed pricing</strong><small>Tell us what your business needs</small><% }else{ %><strong>$<%= format(Number(price)/100) %></strong><span>/<%= interval==='annual'?'year':'month' %></span><small data-price-note><%= interval==='annual'?'Annual charge, paid yearly':'Billed monthly' %></small><% } %></div><div class="plan-card__action"><a class="pub-btn" data-plan-link data-plan="<%= plan.id %>" href="<%= planNavigation.destination(plan,{account:locals.account,subscription:currentSubscription,interval,checkoutOpen}) %>"><%= plan.sales_only?'Email us about Custom':locals.account?'Review '+plan.name:checkoutOpen?'Choose '+plan.name:'Email us about '+plan.name %></a></div><ul class="plan-allowances"><% for(const a of plan.allowances){const number=plan.sales_only&&['ai_work_credits','emails_sent'].includes(a.meter)?'Agreed':a.units==null?'Unlimited':format(a.units),noun=a.meter==='members'?'user':a.meter==='workspaces'?'inventory':String(a.label||'').toLowerCase().replace(/s$/,''); %><li data-allowance="<%= a.meter %>" aria-label="<%= number+' '+(Number(a.units)===1?noun:label(a).toLowerCase()) %>"><span><%= label(a) %><%= ['ai_work_credits','emails_sent'].includes(a.meter)?' / month':'' %></span><strong><%= number %></strong></li><% } %></ul><p class="plan-includes"><%= plan.includesPlan?'Everything in '+plan.includesPlan+', plus':'Includes' %></p><ul class="plan-features"><% for(const feature of plan.incrementalFeatures){ %><li data-plan-feature="<%= feature.capability %>"><%= feature.text %></li><% } %><% if(!plan.incrementalFeatures.length){ %><li>More capacity for the work already included.</li><% } %></ul></article><% } %></section>
<p class="pro-pricing-note">Each active variant counts as one SKU, shared across your inventories. Row allowances apply per import. File-size and format limits also apply; use CSV for the largest imports. Custom ERP connections require agreed source mappings and verification.</p>
<div class="plan-footer"><span>14-day money-back guarantee</span><span>Unused included credits roll over one month</span><span>Usage alerts at 80% and 100%</span><span>Cancel anytime</span></div><p class="pro-pricing-note">An AI question or action can require several steps. Ask and file reading share your AI credits; ordinary browsing and manual work do not use them.</p><section class="pro-addons"><h2>Add more when you need it</h2><p class="pro-pricing-note">Purchased AI credits last 12 months. Auto top-up stays off until you choose a pack and a monthly cap.</p><div class="pro-addon-grid"><% for(const pack of offerPacks){ %><article data-pack="<%= pack.id %>" data-pack-amount-minor="<%= pack.amount_minor %>"><strong><%= format(pack.units) %> <%= pack.category==='ai_work_credits'?'AI credits':'emails' %></strong><span>$<%= format(Number(pack.amount_minor)/100) %></span></article><% } %><% for(const product of capacityProducts){ %><article><strong><%= product.label %></strong><span>$<%= format(Number(product.monthly_amount_minor)/100) %>/month</span></article><% } %></div></section><p class="pro-pricing-note">Your shipping provider bills your own account for postage. Merchant payments reach your connected payment account. <a href="/integrations">See supported connections</a>.</p><p class="pro-pricing-note">A successful subscription refund cancels renewal, keeps workspace records read-only with export access for 30 days, then deletes the workspace data. <a href="/terms">Read the subscription terms</a>.</p></div>
